  charType: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c0929d5203a972646bd8aafa1fdcd9e5, type: 2}
  lineTexts:
  - Pig! You're still in the forest?! Have you decided against going back?
  - I'm sure you'll be better off here!
  - Oh you follow the track of the boars? Great idea, I saw them heading north an
    hour ago!
  - I am glad, you stay in the forest! If you ever need any tips how to manage a
    plan for winter supplies, make sure to contact me!
